- `sessionSettings.sessionTimeout = "2"` with `sessionTimeoutType = "InactivityTimeout"` → 2-hour inactivity timeout (matches the Setup → Session Settings option "Sessions time out after N hours of inactivity").
- `passwordPolicies.minimumPasswordLength = "12"` and `passwordPolicies.passwordExpiration = "90"` (days). These apply in scratch orgs just as in any org.

